-- ============================================================================
-- BULK SEED — generated, do not hand-edit
-- ============================================================================
-- Everything below this line is machine generated. Instruments are real index
-- constituents (S&P 500, FTSE 100, NIFTY 50, then S&P MidCap 400 to fill), kept
-- only where Yahoo actually returned a price, so no fabricated ticker can reach
-- the database and 404 on its first buy. Trades are priced off real daily closes
-- for the instrument and date in question.
--
-- Regenerate with scratchpad/gen_seed.py (seed 20261026) against the market
-- container, which has yfinance and network access:
--   docker exec -i jeepers-leapers-market-1 python - < gen_seed.py
--   docker cp jeepers-leapers-market-1:/tmp/seed_block.sql .
--
-- UUID prefixes keep generated rows separable from the curated ones above:
--   b2100000-…  instruments      a1100000-…  users
--   d4100000-…  accounts         c3100000-…  trades
-- ============================================================================
-- ── Bulk instrument universe ──────────────────────────────────────────────
-- 1000 instruments: real index membership, kept only where Yahoo prices them.
